infographic sequence-funnel-simple
data
  title Coarse-then-fine: 100M places narrowed to k nearest
  desc The cell index is a coarse filter; exact distance is the fine one
  sequences
    - label All places: ~100M worldwide
      desc Never scanned — that is the naive full-table-scan trap
    - label Covering cells: a few hundred candidates
      desc Fetch the user's cell plus its neighbors (3x3 / kRing)
    - label Inside the radius: exact distance survivors
      desc Great-circle math keeps only points genuinely within range
    - label Returned: k nearest, ranked
      desc Final order is a separate scoring step on top of geometry
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
